10348 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The era of mass subsistence gaming had dawned\054 but this primitive P2E model carried a fundamental flaw\056 Even if a player hunted all night and devoted months to crafting an Executioner Sword\054 the result was not legally theirs to keep\056 Under the terms of service\054 ultimate ownership of characters and items belonged to the company\054 NCSoft\073 users were granted only the right to access and use the service\056 This meant that even if someone possessed items worth hundreds of thousands of dollars\054 those assets could vanish without a trace the moment the service shut down or an account was suspended for violating operating policies\056 People were clearly creating value within the virtual world\054 yet its economy was expanding without any legal protection or functional equivalent of a property deed\056\n\nThe figure who most vividly experienced the contradictions of this fragile structure\024and who ultimately changed the course of history\024was none other than Ethereum\031s founder\054 Vitalik Buterin\056 Before becoming known worldwide as A)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 10349 0 R
     /Pg 2112 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

