10446 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Ultimately\054 the lesson left by P2E 1\0560 is clear\056 In a token\055reward economy\054 real wages inevitably converge toward the bottom tier of the global labor market\054 and a digital nation ceases to exist the moment even those workers stop logging in\056 If we hope to build a sustainable virtual nation\054 we must reframe the question\056 Not\054 \034How many tokens should we issue\054 and how should we distribute them\077\035 but rather\054 \034How do we create settlers who will remain in this world even when rewards decline\077\035 If we cannot answer this question\054 the countless X2E projects yet to emerge will be nothing more than temporary encampments for digital nomads\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 10447 0 R
     /Pg 4136 0 R
