10532 0 obj
  << /ActualText (If 19th\055century humanity experienced a migration from farmland to factories\054 the 21st century has begun a great migration from physical reality into digital virtuality\056 What fundamentally distinguishes this digital migration from those of the past is the absence of barriers\056 There is almost no friction\056 With nothing more than a smartphone and an internet connection\024whether in a Philippine slum)
