10613 0 obj
  << /ActualText (define itself as a single game\054 but as a marketplace of experiences\024a digital department store\056 The platform provides the building \050servers\051\054 electricity \050infrastructure\051\054 the payment system \050Robux\051\054 and security \050rules\051\056 On top of this\054 creators open their own shops \050supply\051\054 and users become customers who wander between them \050demand\051\056 Some run small stores in quiet corners\056 Others strike it big in the main hall\056 As creators compete to attract users in their own ways\054 consumption becomes the foundation of the system\056 More content increases dwell time\056 More dwell time increases spending\056 And that spending\054 in turn\054 rewards creators\024forming a self\055reinforcing cycle\056\n\nThe blueprint X2E 2\0560 should follow is not an Axie\055style mine that people dig and abandon\054 but a Roblox\055style department store where people linger\054 wander\054 consume\054 and work\056 Instead of merely expanding the list of actions\054 designers must shape the motivations that bring users in\056 Then they must provide the stage and the rules for each type of motivation to stay\054 spend\054 and create\056 Only then will the X2E metaverse become not a workplace people escape from\024but a world where people remain and build their lives\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 10614 0 R
     /Pg 7156 0 R
     /S /Span
