10621 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In the previous section\054 we examined what kind of city\055state X2E 2\0560 must build internally\056 However\054 for a city\055state to function as a true nation\054 internal order alone is not enough\056 It needs trade routes connecting it to the outside world\054 a currency people trust\054 and steady flows of population\056 X2E 2\0560 is no different\056 If internal incentive design is the heart of the economy\054 then ecosystem integration is the work of connecting blood vessels to that heart\056\n\nHere we must face an uncomfortable truth\072 building a self\055contained monetary economy around a single\054 unknown new token is extraordinarily difficult\024no matter how ambitious the design\056 Countless P2E 1\0560 projects chose exactly this path of the \034isolated kingdom\056\035 From the throne of the token issuer\054 they conducted airdrops\054 sold tokens\054 and proclaimed\072 \034This token will be used as currency in our game\056\035 But on what basis should users trust a token that is neither Bitcoin nor the dollar\077 Because this foundation of trust was so thin\054 the outcome was almost always the same\056 The moment early participants took profits and left\054 prices collapsed\056 The ecosystem\054 unable to absorb the shock\054 collapsed with them\056\n\nThe strategy X2E 2\0560 must adopt is therefore clear\056 Instead of declaring sovereignty from nothing\054 it must anchor itself to an existing civilization\056 In practice\054 this means a dual\055layer design\072 a proven base currency as the foundation\054 and a utility token layered on top to govern the service\031s functions and rules\056 A cryptocurrency that already has a large user base and deep liquidity can serve as a kind of \034community currency\035 within the ecosystem\056 By standing on this foundation\054 new projects can dramatically reduce the cost of having to manufacture trust from zero\056\n\nThe case of Bonk on Solana and the ecosystem built around it demonstrates how this strategy works in reality\056 On the surface\054 Bonk looks like just another meme token with a dog mascot\056 But its real value lies in the liquidity and social cohesion already accumulated around it\056 With hundreds of thousands of holdersXVII and listings on major exchanges\054XVIII BONK has secured a solid position within the Solana ecosystem\056 Built on top of this foundation\054 BONKfun \050)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 10622 0 R
     /Pg 7156 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

