10630 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\050the Bonk launchpad10\051\051 integrates token issuance and initial distribution directly into Bonk\031s liquidity network\054 in collaboration with Raydium and the Bonk community\056 The most important feature is its fee allocation structure\072 a portion of platform profits is used to buy back and burn BONK\056 This is not just theory\056 In December 2025\054 the platform demonstrated the system\031s effectiveness by executing massive buybacks while also recording its highest profits since launch\056XIX This feedback loop shows that BONKfun\031s growth is not merely a narrative\024it functions as a real economic engine that increases the token\031s scarcity\056 It is a clear example of a self\055reinforcing cycle\072 the existing community\031s liquidity and attention become the service\031s launch momentum\054 and the service\031s growth\054 in turn\054 strengthens the token economy\056\n\nThis kind of interlocking design gives users a powerful psychological safety net\056 New tokens are inherently volatile\054 but the moment they are anchored to an established currency\054 people gain confidence that they \034won\031t become worthless overnight\056\035 This is\054 in essence\054 the process of joining civilization\056 Trying to gather users in a barren wasteland is like trying to build a city in the wilderness\056 Opening a shop in a square where people already gather is a completely different game\056 Instead of shouting through a megaphone in the desert\054 set up a stall along a busy trade route\056 This is the most efficient customer acquisition strategy available to latecomers\056\n\nUltimately\054 what the Bonk case suggests is not \034play around with meme tokens\056\035 The real lesson is this\072 X2E 2\0560 must abandon isolationism\024the fantasy of building its own kingdom and its own currency from scratch\056 Only by entering a federation\024by connecting to and cooperating with other ecosystems\024can the \034people who commute into games for work\035 finally step onto solid ground each morning with peace of mind\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 10631 0 R
     /Pg 7558 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

