10675 0 obj
  << /ActualText (AI brings the era of traditional labor to a close\054 we are being forced to rewrite the definition of work itself\056 Whether this great digital migration becomes a miserable exile\054 or a second Renaissance growing from barren soil\054 depends entirely on our design\056 What we need at this crossroads is neither vague optimism nor helpless pessimism\054 but a robust system and philosophy that prevents humans from becoming mere cogs in a machine\056 In the near future\054 games and the metaverse will become humanity\031s next dwelling place\024where we form connections\054 protect one another\054 and rebuild our lives\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
